{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1299576-home-brew-merit-beast-tongues","id":1299576,"title":"Home-Brew Merit; Beast Tongues","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-25T06:28:06-07:00","id":1299576,"title":"Home-Brew Merit; Beast Tongues","content":"<span style=\"font-size:18px\">Beast Tongues; 1, 2 or 4 point supernatural merit.</span><br /> <br /> You have a natural understanding of animals and beasts which defies the parameters of spherical magick. Whether through direct translation into &quot;human speech&quot; within your mind or a &quot;strong hunch&quot;, you perfectly understand what animals are trying to say... and you might even be able to reply.<br /> <br /> The 1 point version of this merit allows you to understand what animal Familiars of other Mages are saying, along with other &quot;enhanced&quot; animals, from kinfolk to experimental animals with heightened intelligence. The 2 point version allows you to understand all animals, and reduces the difficulty of all animal kinship rolls by 1. The 4 point version allows you to both understand and speak to animals (either through mimicking the animal's own tongue, or speaking in your own, depending on personal belief), although it doesn't grant an innate supernatural command. This version reduces the difficulty of all animal kinship and ride rolls by 2 (so long as you are able to speak to the animal verbally). This version of the merit also grants a useful focus for Mind effects that command animals (or Mind + Spirit in the case of Familiars and kinfolk), potentially reducing the difficulty by 2 at storyteller discretion.<br /> <br /> This merit goes well with merits like Shapechanger Kin, Fae Blooded, Natural Shapeshifter, Natural Channel and similar. Abusing this gift in front of Sleepers does not garner Paradox, but it will naturally attract negative or incredulous attention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11620,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","user":"twig","date":". 03-25-2019, 09:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}